  "changes": [
    "FpsPlayer publishes PlayerHudChanged snapshots through a cached IEventManager EventChannel after accepted ammo/reload transitions and visible hit-marker/kill changes.",
    "FpsHudViewModel caches its channel delegate, subscribes then reads an initial snapshot, filters by player reference and Entity.Id, and unsubscribes on MvvmView close. No per-frame HUD Refresh remains.",
    "Only an active hit marker checks unscaled expiry during EntityLogic updates; movement/FOV/animation/ability cooldown retain their appropriate per-frame logic.",
    "Regression coverage counts real channel handlers/events and bound uGUI changes, repeated pause/resume, closed-period changes, pooled target/stale-model isolation and production exit/reentry.",
    "Project instructions now explicitly route Framework defects and missing general capabilities through fork fixes/regressions/upstream PRs; local adoption pins the tested full fork SHA without waiting for maintainer approval."
  ],
